flowchart LR
    U[User / Web App] -->|Upload original image| S3IN[(Amazon S3<br/>Source bucket<br/>incoming/)]
    S3IN -->|ObjectCreated event| Q[[Amazon SQS Standard Queue]]
    Q -->|Event source mapping| L[AWS Lambda<br/>Validate + resize]
    L -->|Read original| S3IN
    L -->|Write thumbnail| S3OUT[(Amazon S3<br/>Destination bucket<br/>thumbnails/)]
    Q -. redrive after repeated failures .-> DLQ[[Amazon SQS DLQ]]
    L --> CW[Amazon CloudWatch<br/>Logs + metrics]
    IAM[AWS IAM<br/>Least-privilege role] -. authorizes .-> L
    S3IN -. private + encryption .-> SEC[Security controls]
    S3OUT -. private + encryption .-> SEC
